1
00:00:00,979 --> 00:00:05,139
I wish I had known that before
I posted all those pictures on Facebook.

2
00:00:07,653 --> 00:00:11,523
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)All right. Let's hit the road. I wouldn't mind
shooting some ducks in the morning.

3
00:00:11,723 --> 00:00:14,053
(Howard:)Wait, now we're shooting things?

4
00:00:14,993 --> 00:00:16,923
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)I like using a big shell.

5
00:00:17,129 --> 00:00:20,429
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You can't eat them afterwards
but it's fun watching them blow up.

6
00:00:25,137 --> 00:00:31,307
(Howard:)Sir, I'm flattered that you invited me
and I really want you to like me...

7
00:00:31,510 --> 00:00:36,850
(Howard:)...but I don't think this trip is the way to do it.

8
00:00:37,983 --> 00:00:41,643
(Howard:)And I can't return these things
if there's chunks of duck all over them.

9
00:00:42,087 --> 00:00:46,047
- So why'd you agree to come?
- Because Bernadette made me.

10
00:00:46,258 --> 00:00:50,558
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)I tried to back out too.
My wife said I had to go.

11
00:00:50,762 --> 00:00:54,992
(Howard:)Really? Your wife makes you do stuff?
You're a big, scary cop.

12
00:00:55,667 --> 00:00:58,227
(Mr. Rostenkowski:)You're an astronaut
and your wife makes you do things...

